# Assignment 10 - Sara7a App (Week 1)
- User Authentication (Signup & Signin) with bcrypt and JWT
- User Profile management (Get, Update, Delete)
- Auth Middleware for route protection
- MongoDB with Mongoose

## Run
1. 
pm install
2. 
pm start
3. Test using \Assignment10.postman_collection.json\
